  "agentSummary": "I found 12 external services and recorded each with its call sites. I read the code myself rather than fanning out to subagents, because the repo is small.\n\n- **Stripe, SDK** (`stripe`, pinned API `2024-06-20` in `lib/utils.ts:10`): billing portal, customer creation, checkout sessions, and subscription and invoice retrieval.\n- **Stripe, webhook** (`app/api/webhook/stripe/route.ts`): verifies the signature, then handles `checkout.session.completed` and `customer.subscription.updated` and `.deleted`.\n- **Raynet CRM, raw HTTP** (`app.raynet.cz/api/v2`): company create, lookup and update, called through both `fetch` and `axios`. The request at `actions/users.tsx:430` is a `fetch` I did not confirm the method of.\n- **SmartEmailing, raw HTTP** (`app.smartemailing.cz/api/v3`): contact lookup and import.\n- **iDoklad, raw HTTP via axios** (`identity.idoklad.cz` for the token, `api.idoklad.cz/v3` for contacts and invoices).\n- **Google reCAPTCHA**: server-side `siteverify` fetch in `actions/captcha.ts`. The client side uses `react-google-recaptcha-v3`.\n- **Sanity, SDK** (`next-sanity`, API version `2024-08-05`): GROQ queries through the `sanityFetch` wrapper in `sanity/lib/client.ts`, which many pages call. I recorded the two `client.fetch` lines inside the wrapper, not each page.\n- **Sanity CDN, raw HTTP**: `app/api/downloadPdf/route.ts` fetches a hardcoded PDF from `cdn.sanity.io`.\n- **Gmail via nodemailer**: sends transactional email over Gmail's SMTP service, not an HTTP API. I recorded it with a note because the mail is sent through Gmail rather than an operator-configured server.\n- **Upstash Redis, SDK**: session storage in `database/session.ts`.\n- **Turso (libSQL), SDK**: 26 `turso.execute` sites. It is a hosted database reached through a driver, so I included it deliberately.\n- **Google Analytics**: `GoogleAnalytics` component in `app/layout.tsx`.\n- **Calendly**: inline widget in `components/calendlyPop.tsx`.\n\n**Not recorded, because I found no code that uses them:**\n- Declared but apparently unused packages: `openai`, `ai`, `twilio`, and the Supabase packages. Supabase appears only as a type import in `types/index.d.ts`.\n- `mapbox-gl` only has its CSS imported in `components/contact.tsx`. The map on that page is a Google Maps iframe embed.\n- Plain outbound links and iframes, such as YouTube, Facebook and Instagram.\n\nI did not read lines 131–861 of `actions/users.tsx` in full. I recorded its Raynet, Stripe and email call sites from grep matches and a few targeted reads, so some neighbouring code there may be unread.",
